      "stealth": {
        "details": "<p>For APL 11, set the HP to 60 and reduce the saves by 2.</p><p>For APL 12, set the HP to 70 and increase the saves by 1.</p>",
        "value": 0
      }
    },
    "details": {
      "description": "<p>Recall Knowledge: <strong>#DC# </strong>Arcana, Nature or Crafting.<br />These masks seem tied to Lethallica's life force. Even if they were defeated, they could use one of those masks to rise again.</p><p>Even on a failed Recall Knowledge check, someone at least expert in Arcana, Nature or Crafting recognizes the metal that each mask and pool is made of, revealing their names.</p><p>This mask is <strong>not</strong> automatically destroyed by effects such as <em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.r7ihOgKv19eJQnik]{Disintegrate}</em> and is instead affected as if it was a creature. It doesn't get <span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\">a result one degree of success worse than the outcome of its save for being critically hit</span>. Resistance and hardness apply normally.</p>",
